(Other update paths — visibility, pinned, state, timestamps — do not touch content and therefore do not trigger recomputation.)

**Extracted properties** (from `internal/markdown/markdown.go:362-419`, mirroring `storepb.MemoPayload_Property` at `proto/store/memo.proto:15-21`):
- `Tags` — every `#tag` found in the content (deduplicated, case preserved).
- `Property.Title` — text of the first-level (`H1`) heading, if it's the document's first block.
- `Property.HasLink` — whether any markdown link is present.
- `Property.HasCode` — whether any code block/fenced code block/code span is present.
- `Property.HasTaskList` — whether any task-list checkbox is present.
- `Property.HasIncompleteTasks` — whether any task-list checkbox is unchecked.

(`ExtractedData` also carries `Mentions` — `@username` references — but `RebuildMemoPayload` discards that field; only `Tags` and `Property` are persisted into `memo.Payload`, which is what memo list/preview responses read from, e.g. via `convertMemoFromStore` in the API service.)
